          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Several witnesses observed the random movements of two lights of different intensities: astronomical observations of Jupiter and Aldebaran with autokinetic illusion.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "a27a478cbbfa390bc667e08214c47861e5d23f72c88fba9b986622b4d5e66d88"
